  "Walking in a pool or a relaxed dance.": "在泳池中行走或轻松跳舞。",
  "Strength training helps turn extra calories into muscle. Eat a snack within an hour after exercise.": "力量训练有助于把多余的热量转化为肌肉。运动后一小时内吃点零食。",
  "Mix cardio, strength and stretching to keep your weight and energy steady.": "把有氧、力量和拉伸结合起来，有助于保持体重和精力稳定。",
  "Low-impact activity protects your joints. Consistency matters more than intensity.": "低冲击运动能保护关节。坚持比强度更重要。",
  "Start small and add a few minutes each week. Every bit of movement counts.": "从小处开始，每周增加几分钟。每一点运动都有意义。",
  "Keep your heart rate up with brisk walking, cycling, or dancing. Try to move for at least 20-30 minutes most days.": "通过快走、骑行或跳舞保持较高心率。尽量在大多数日子里运动至少 20-30 分钟。",
  "Try strength exercises like push-ups, squats, or lifting weights 2-3 times a week. This helps build muscle and boosts your metabolism.": "每周做 2-3 次力量训练，如俯卧撑、深蹲或举重。这有助于增肌并提高新陈代谢。",
  "Include activities that you genuinely enjoy, whether it's dancing, swimming, gardening, or sports. When you have fun, you're more likely to stick with it.": "选择您真正喜欢的活动，无论是跳舞、游泳、园艺还是运动。玩得开心，才更容易坚持。",
